OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of sexually assaulting
OL,4,Agirls at hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court after being
OL,7,Fcharged in connection with the sexual
OL,8,Fassault of two girls in Kenilworth.
OL,10,FAhmad Hania was detained after police
OL,11,Fwere called on Monday evening to a
OL,12,Fhotel in the town where they located
OL,13,Fboth victims.
OL,15,FHania, of King Edward Road in Nuneaton,
OL,16,Fwas arrested that night at his home and
OL,17,Fhas been charged with a series of
OL,18,Fsexual offences, Warwickshire Police
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
