OL,4,Agirls at hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Syrian national appeared at
OL,7,FCoventry Magistrates' Court on Tuesday
OL,8,Fmorning and was remanded in custody. He
OL,9,Fis next due to appear at Warwick Crown
OL,10,FCourt on 17 September.
